    "dos": ["Do keep the page on newsprint with sheet fills for inputs and panels.", "Do use pen blue for anything the student did, highlighter only behind explanation, stamp red only for deadlines and conflicts.", "Do build lists as ruled entries under a 2px ink rule, with tabular numerals.", "Do keep targets at 44px and the 3px pen focus outline.", "Do respect prefers-color-scheme and prefers-reduced-motion."],
